<title>USA: IMM currency futures finish sharply lower.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures finish sharply lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>Nov 25 - Key IMM currency futures finished sharply lower in light to moderate trading, led by steep losses in marks on news Italy had gained re-entry into ERM. Support in December marks seen at $0.6550. Cash dollar/mark resistance was pegged at 1.5250, traders said.</p>
<p>-Derivatives Desk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
